        {"id":"ssc-general-math-chapter-02-model-test-04-q05","text":"A = {১, ২, ৩}, B = {১, ২, ৩, ৪}, C = {২, ৩} হলে নিচের কোনটি সত্য?","options":["B ⊂ A","A ⊂ C","C ⊂ A","৪ ∈ A"],"answer":"C ⊂ A","answerIndex":2},
        {"id":"ssc-general-math-chapter-02-model-test-04-q06","text":"A = {১, ২, ৩} হলে নিচের কোনটি A-এর উপসেট নয়?","options":["{১}","{১, ৩}","{২, ৩}","{১, ৪}"],"answer":"{১, ৪}","answerIndex":3},
